Z||000007||Little Duce Coupe||11-14-2001||03:55 PM||||When I first bought mine it had a similar problem, then at one point on the way to work it just died and would not restart even roughly.<P>Turned out to be the fuel pump, it was giving out and the pressure wasn't steady thus the up and down on the rpm.<P>Just my 2 bits<P>Good luck!<P>------------------<BR>Little Duce Coupe<BR>"You Don't Know What She Costs"||||reg||3
